<title>JAPAN: Japan March zinc imports surge 177 pct yr/yr--MOF.</title>
<headline>Japan March zinc imports surge 177 pct yr/yr--MOF.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's refined zinc imports in March surged 177 percent to 9,038 tonnes from 3,261 tonnes in the same month a year earlier, Finance Ministry data released on Monday showed.</p>
<p>Figures were as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>			Mar 97    Feb 97	Mar 96</p>
<p> Total		 9,038     7,940	 3,261</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p> China		 7,384     5,989	 1,625</p>
<p>Refined zinc imports in the first three months of calendar 1997 were 26,067 tonnes, sharply up from 18,502 tonnes in the same period last year.</p>
<p>--Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
